{
  "map": "UndeadRE01",
  "title": "Arcane Sanctuary",
  "locale": "zhCN",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "这是什么地方？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1143,
        "speaker_string_id": 1144,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-010-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "一个法师创造了一个口袋维度，用来存放他们的破烂。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1152,
        "speaker_string_id": 1153,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-020-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "不出所料，里面全是构造体守卫，也许还藏了很多陷阱。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1161,
        "speaker_string_id": 1162,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-030-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "我们需要利用这些传送门在各个房间中穿行。希望最后能找到一些好东西，让我们不枉此行。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1169,
        "speaker_string_id": 1170,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-C010-040-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "似乎这东西能安装在传送门的框架中。我打赌这就是我们需要的能量源。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 873,
        "speaker_string_id": 874,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T020-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "这道传送门看上去已经陷入休眠。可能需要某种能量源才能启动。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 848,
        "speaker_string_id": 849,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T010-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "这群可恶的法师总喜欢耍些他们的小花招。我们只能原路返回了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 908,
        "speaker_string_id": 909,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T030-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "如果我们能移开挡路的障碍物，这道光束也许能启动下一道传送门。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 950,
        "speaker_string_id": 951,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T040-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "那只是个幻象！真正的神器一定藏在宝库的其他地方。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 992,
        "speaker_string_id": 993,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T050-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "我们继续搜寻吧。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 994,
        "speaker_string_id": 995,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T060-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "看来这就是真正的神器了。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 998,
        "speaker_string_id": 999,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T070-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "恩雅",
      "text": "终于找到了。把这该死的东西拿回去给莱克斯顿吧。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 1006,
        "speaker_string_id": 1007,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M5-T080-ANYA"
      }
    }
  ]
}